OL,3,GNEWSACall for action to fix 'forgotten'
OL,4,Aplayground
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillors are calling for an urgent
OL,7,Ffix to a children's park in
OL,8,FHuddersfield after branding it one of
OL,9,Fthe "worst playgrounds in the north of
OL,10,FEngland".
OL,12,FFor five years, councillors in Crosland
OL,13,FMoor say they have been campaigning to
OL,14,Frepair the "long-forgotten" Rashcliffe
OL,15,FPark.
OL,17,FParents have said they are worried
OL,18,Fabout children being injured in the
OL,19,Fpark because of issues including
OL,20,Fupturned and cracking rubber flooring,
OL,21,Fand missing gates that lead onto a main
OL,22,Froad.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,390,380,200,160,0,100
